The '''Antimatter Fruit''' is a [[Fruit Treasures|Fruit Treasure]] found in [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. It improves the effect of most [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] [[Special Abilities|abilities]].

==Effect==
At 100% on all Antimatter Fruit Treasures, the following [[Special Abilities|abilities]] are enhanced when used against [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie Enemies]]:
