==Trivia==
*Despite being listed seventh in the [[Treasure]] menu, the Antimatter Fruit is actually the fourth obtainable Cats of the Cosmos Treasure.
*The Antimatter Fruit originally only improved the Weaken effect's duration by 10% and the Knockback effect's distance by 20%. This was changed at an unknown date.
*The Antimatter Fruit, like other fruits is based on a real-life fruit, these being strawberries.
